":"Full hookup","meaning":"The site connects your RV to power, water and sewer."},{"term":"Back-in site","meaning":"An RV site you reverse into."}]},{"label":"30/50amp - full hookup pull-through (site# 4-11)","price":40,"optionIdx":2,"explain":[{"term":"Pull-through","meaning":"An RV site you drive straight through, so there is no backing in."}]},{"label":"30amp - full hookup - back-in (site# M1)","price":43,"optionIdx":3},{"label":"1/2 day PM","price":50,"optionIdx":4},{"label":"1/2 day AM","price":60,"optionIdx":5},{"label":"All day","price":75,"optionIdx":6}]},{"name":"TENT site","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ac7d7efd274cbf354ccf23e/1526792742314-ARMQ825Y1KQ9377MBF3J/Bridgeport_Reservoir_Marina_and_Campground_01_white.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":7}]},{"name":"Rental Fleet","desc":"Cruise around the lake on one of our 2 Pontoons. Each is geared towards fishing with rod holders and ample space on board. 1 is good for trolling and the other is good for bait fishing/ fly fishing. Depth finder included. Fuel and personal flotation devices (PFDs) included for adults and children 30 lbs and up. If child is under 30 lbs please bring your own PFD for them. Per California State Law, all children 12 and under must where a life jacket at all times while on the craft. Music/radio is NOT provided please bring your own Bluetooth speaker. Good for bait and fly fishing. Accommodates up to 4 people with seats, steering, and depth finder. No dogs allowed, sorry. Fuel and personal","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ac7d7efd274cbf354ccf23e/1526792742314-ARMQ825Y1KQ9377MBF3J/Bridgeport_Reservoir_Marina_and_Campground_01_white.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"tent cabins","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ac7d7efd274cbf354ccf23e/1526792742314-ARMQ825Y1KQ9377MBF3J/Bridgeport_Reservoir_Marina_a